    "detailed_description": "Explore the city imbued with the gloomy atmosphere of night and neon, work your way through it to solve the mystery that's been eating you for years, fight hot vampire hotties, improve your skills and buy powerful implants - the game has an RPG-styled fight system and a roguelike mode to take a fun break from the story!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657030/extras/68be9bc38b5e51be720b43fe6fe425e5.poster.avif?t=1754827360\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657030/extras/68be9bc38b5e51be720b43fe6fe425e5.webm?t=1754827360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657030/extras/68be9bc38b5e51be720b43fe6fe425e5.mp4?t=1754827360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In a cyberpunk world ravaged by mutation, vampires with superhuman abilities have enslaved humanity, turning people into nothing more than food and slaves - you're not happy with that, to say the least. Years ago, your friend\u2019s family was brutally murdered by vampires, and Kaira herself disappeared without a trace. Ever since, you\u2019re on a mission of vengeance, fighting vampires to grow stronger in the hopes of finding her.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657030/extras/e9d68aadd620aff3d4909aa3e8ac170c.poster.avif?t=1754827360\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657030/extras/e9d68aadd620aff3d4909aa3e8ac170c.webm?t=1754827360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657030/extras/e9d68aadd620aff3d4909aa3e8ac170c.mp4?t=1754827360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The story begins as you return to your hometown, a city divided by different vampire gangs. You\u2019re hired to take down the city\u2019s most powerful vampire \u2013 the mysterious Queen. Investigation leads you to using every trick in the book \u2013 intimidation, bribery, and murder \u2013 to navigate through the overtaken city, find the local gang leader and discover the human meat processing factory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657030/extras/62de33028a862f427e98ccca56dbb029.poster.avif?t=1754827360\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657030/extras/62de33028a862f427e98ccca56dbb029.webm?t=1754827360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657030/extras/62de33028a862f427e98ccca56dbb029.mp4?t=1754827360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>After your cover gets blown, and you fight everyone there, you head to the corporate tower, inside which you\u2019ll face a few other queen's henchwomen until you find the Queen herself. Who\u2019s she? Where\u2019s Kaira? What will happen when you finally meet? How will the final fight end? Play and find out!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657030/extras/01ecf6abac113088eec8ee2990f1af3d.poster.avif?t=1754827360\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657030/extras/01ecf6abac113088eec8ee2990f1af3d.webm?t=1754827360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657030/extras/01ecf6abac113088eec8ee2990f1af3d.mp4?t=1754827360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Adult themes \ud83d\udd1e - loss, revenge, determination and lots of sex, of course!<br></li><li>Top-notch visuals \ud83c\udf1f - neon nighttime futuristic vistas with an extremely stylish high-quality rendering.<br></li><li>Next-level animation \ud83c\udf9e - lush, smooth and juicy animations showcasing the action from many angles.<br></li><li>Intriguing detective plot \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f - trust us, you don\u2019t expect the final twist.<br></li><li>Fighting system \u2694 - battle the hotties in the turn-based dice &amp; stats system in order to get what you need.<br></li><li>Character progression \ud83d\udd3c - improve your stats, install implants and build the character the way YOU like it!<br></li><li>Roguelike mini-game - getting tired of reading? No problem, launch the roguelike and fight vampire girlies one after the other!</li></ul>",
